      "text": "Rupert Pupkin is a delusional aspiring comedian who lives with his mother and spends his days fantasizing about stardom while practicing his routines in a makeshift basement studio. His obsession with talk show host Jerry Langford drives him to stalk the celebrity, convinced that one appearance on Langford's show will launch his career. When polite rejection fails to deter him, Pupkin's fantasy world collides violently with reality as he kidnaps Langford with the help of fellow stalker Masha, demanding a spot on the show as ransom. De Niro's Pupkin is a masterclass in uncomfortable character study - a man so divorced from reality that his delusions become indistinguishable from truth, making viewers squirm as they simultaneously pity and fear him."
